,p_static_id=>'STYLE'
,p_prompt=>'Style'
,p_attribute_type=>'SELECT LIST'
,p_is_required=>true
,p_default_value=>'classicInvoice'
,p_escape_mode=>'ATTR'
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_help_text=>'Document design; the direction is given after the name. classicInvoice - bold: an A4 sheet on the page with ledger rules, a single rule above the subtotal, a double rule under the total and an inked rubber stamp for the status. modernMinimal - smart: no table grid; when the region is wide the dates and party sit in a rail beside the lines, when narrow the total moves to the top; the due date is counted in days. bilingualTax - smart: ZATCA-style tax invoice with every label in English and Arabic, seller and buyer VAT numbers, per-line VAT amount and total including VAT, Hijri date and an optional QR image. thermalReceipt - depth: an 80 mm paper strip with torn edges lifted off the page, dotted leaders and a centred total; prints on 80 mm paper. payslip - motion: earnings and deductions side by side, gross, deductions and net pay, and a pay split bar that settles once; VAT is ignored. Under reduced motion the stamp and the bar appear without movement.'
);
